On the riverside stone pavement outside the castle, Henri carries Léa in his arms, his stooped frame angled toward his car parked along the street by the Landvogteischloss. Henri, wearing his long grey wool overcoat, orange knitted wool scarf, brown corduroy trousers, and black shoes, with short combed gray hair and full beard, holds Léa securely against his chest as he looks down at her with a calm, reassuring gaze. Léa, in her red knit cardigan, white shirt, grey trousers, and brown boots, clings with both arms around Henri's neck, her brown eyes wide and worried as she looks up at his chin. On the damp grey pavement beneath them, stretched across the stone flags near a tall black iron lamppost, lies l'ombre — a flat, solid near-black shadow shape of long thin limbs and smooth head, cast along the ground. In the background, the stepped-gable stone walls and round stair turret of the castle rise against the forested hills covered in rich orange and brown autumn foliage, while to the side, the brown-tiled roof of the covered wooden bridge spans the river in the fading dusk light. Distant pedestrians in dark overcoats walk along the far castle wall. Ultra-wide shot framing the full street scene, the castle architecture, and the figures on the pavement.

---METADATA---
{"sceneIntent":"Henri carries Léa across the pavement near the Landvogteischloss toward his car, while the long dark shadow stretches on the stone flags below them. The stepped-gable castle rises behind them at dusk.","characters":[{"name":"Henri","clothing":"standard","position":"on the pavement","depth":"midground","footing":"ground","expression":"brows soft, eyes attentive, mouth closed"},{"name":"Léa","clothing":"standard","position":"in Henri's arms","depth":"midground","footing":"ground","expression":"brows drawn up, eyes wide, mouth open slightly"}],"era":"present day","weather":"drizzle","interactions":[{"character":"Henri","object":"Léa","where":"carries Léa in his arms","action":"carrying Léa","hands":true,"storyRelevant":true,"priority":"essential"},{"character":"Léa","object":"Henri","where":"holds Henri around the neck","action":"holding Henri","hands":true,"storyRelevant":false,"priority":"normal"}]}

In the upstairs family bathroom, Élodie — an average-build young adult woman with loose mid-back light brown wavy hair parted in the centre, brown eyes, and a soft jawline — kneels on the grey bath mat beside the white enamel bathtub, facing left. She wears her yellow chunky knit turtleneck sweater, long black cotton skirt, black opaque tights, black leather ankle boots, and a small silver necklace. Her fingers grip the shiny chrome tap handle, turning it firmly as a roaring torrent of steaming water gushes into the basin, filling the tub with white foam and rising bubbles. Her gaze is focused downward on the metal tap in her grasp, her face calm and serene. The white-tiled bathroom walls gleam softly in the indoor dusk light, with a folded blue towel hanging on the wall rail beside the tub, and a small frosted side window revealing the dark silhouettes of autumn branches outside. Medium shot centered on the tub and Élodie kneeling at the edge.

---METADATA---
{"sceneIntent":"Élodie kneels by the bathtub and turns the chrome tap, water roaring into the tub with foam and bubbles. The bathroom has white tiles and a blue towel on the wall.","characters":[{"name":"Élodie","clothing":"standard","position":"kneeling beside the bathtub","depth":"foreground","footing":"ground","expression":"brows level, eyes focused downward, mouth closed"}],"era":"present day","weather":"none","interactions":[{"character":"Élodie","object":"LOC003.1","where":"turns the chrome tap handle","action":"turning the tap","hands":true,"storyRelevant":true,"priority":"essential"}]}

Looking down into the white enamel bathtub from above, Jules and Léa sit together inside the water among mounds of white soap bubbles, while Élodie kneels along the outer tiled edge. Jules — a slim kindergarten-age boy about five heads tall with short combed dark brown straight hair, bangs above his eyebrows, blue eyes, and soft features — sits facing right, his hands cupping a small pile of foam as he looks down intently at his palms, his mouth open as he counts bubbles aloud. Léa sits beside him facing left, holding both hands up before her chest with fingers spread out, counting along, but her brown eyes dart anxiously sideways toward Jules, her brow furrowed. Élodie leans over the tub rim from the side, looking down at Léa with an attentive, steady expression. Lying flat along the smooth white curved rim of the tub right beside Léa, the solid near-black shape of l'ombre stretches its smooth, featureless dark arm across the enamel surface. The tiled floor surrounds the tub, with a grey bath mat and a blue towel folded on a small stool. High-angle shot looking directly down into the bubbling bath.

---METADATA---
{"sceneIntent":"Jules counts soap bubbles in his hands while Léa counts on her fingers inside the bathtub, with Élodie watching from the rim and the dark shadow lying across the tub edge. The tub is filled with white foam.","characters":[{"name":"Léa","clothing":"standard","position":"inside the bathtub","depth":"foreground","footing":"ground","expression":"brows knit, eyes wide and anxious, lips pressed tight"},{"name":"Jules","clothing":"standard","position":"inside the bathtub beside Léa","depth":"foreground","footing":"ground","expression":"brows neutral, eyes focused on hands, mouth open in speech"},{"name":"Élodie","clothing":"standard","position":"kneeling at the tub rim","depth":"midground","footing":"ground","expression":"brows soft, eyes watching Léa, mouth relaxed"}],"era":"present day","weather":"none","interactions":[{"character":"Jules","object":"LOC003.2","where":"holds a mound of foam","action":"holding foam","hands":true,"storyRelevant":true,"priority":"essential"},{"character":"Léa","object":"Jules","where":"counts on her fingers","action":"counting on fingers","hands":true,"storyRelevant":true,"priority":"normal"},{"character":"Élodie","object":"Léa","where":"watches Léa","action":"watching","hands":false,"storyRelevant":false,"priority":"low"}]}

In a tight close-up at the edge of the bathtub, Léa leans close to Élodie's ear, whispering urgently with her brown eyes fixed straight ahead on Élodie's cheek, her chin-length brown hair and bangs damp around her soft rounded face. Her brow is pulled up in worry and her small lips are parted near Élodie's hair. Élodie turns her head slightly toward Léa, her light brown wavy hair brushing her yellow knit turtleneck collar and her small silver necklace resting at her throat, her brown eyes gazing back at Léa with a calm, patient, unbothered expression. Below them, across the curved white enamel rim of the tub, lies the flat, featureless solid black silhouette of l'ombre's arm, stretching along the porcelain beside the gleaming chrome tap and the white-tiled wall. Close-up shot framed tightly from the shoulders up, capturing their faces and the shadow on the tub rim.

---METADATA---
