In the downstairs living room, Marc — an average-build young adult man with short wavy dark brown hair brushed back with a side part, brown eyes, and an angular jawline — stands upright in the centre of the room, facing right. He wears his brown waxed cotton field jacket with flap chest pockets over a buttoned white henley shirt, dark blue denim jeans with a black leather belt, and brown leather lace-up boots. In his hands he holds ART002.1, the closed teal cloth-covered picture book, its cream page edges visible along the side, his brown eyes looking down intently at the closed cover as his mouth opens to begin his slow countdown from ten. Behind him, the living room is arranged with a grey fabric sofa draped in a knitted throw, a low wooden coffee table holding a ceramic mug over a red-and-cream wool rug, and tall wooden bookshelves filled with books along the cream wall. Through the side window, the dim dusk sky silhouettes autumn trees outside. Medium shot showing Marc from head to boots in the warm living room.

---METADATA---
{"sceneIntent":"Marc stands in the living room holding the closed teal picture book and begins counting down aloud from ten. The room features a grey sofa and wooden bookshelves at dusk.","characters":[{"name":"Marc","clothing":"standard","position":"in the center of the living room","depth":"foreground","footing":"ground","expression":"brows level, eyes focused on the book, mouth open speaking"}],"era":"present day","weather":"none","interactions":[{"character":"Marc","object":"ART002.1","where":"holds the closed picture book in both hands","action":"holding the picture book","hands":true,"storyRelevant":true,"priority":"essential"}]}

In a tight close-up across the child's single bed, the dark, solid near-black shape of l'ombre stretches flat and featureless over the white pillow and the smooth blue-printed duvet. Tucked beneath the duvet right where the shadow's chest would be, only one long, floppy cream fabric ear of ART001, Pompon the plush rabbit, sticks out into the dim dusk light, its soft fabric resting against the smooth bed linen. The wooden headboard rises at the side against the pale green bedroom wall, and the edge of a wooden bedside table holding a small round tin is visible beside the mattress. No human figures are present. Close-up shot focused tightly on the bed surface, the covering shadow, and the single protruding plush ear.

---METADATA---
{"sceneIntent":"The long dark shadow lies flat across the white pillow and blue-printed duvet on the child's bed, with only one long ear of Pompon the plush rabbit sticking out. The bedroom wall is pale green at dusk.","characters":[],"era":"present day","weather":"none","interactions":[]}

In the upstairs corridor just outside the partly open bedroom door, Léa stamps her bare foot firmly down onto the pale wooden floorboards. Léa, wearing her nightwear of a purple cotton long-sleeve pyjama top with front buttons, matching purple pyjama trousers, and bare feet, stands facing left toward the bedroom doorway, her brown chin-length hair swinging, her brows knit in frustration and her mouth firmly set as she looks at the doorway floor. Beside her stands Jules in his nightwear, wearing a blue cotton short-sleeve pyjama top, blue pyjama shorts, and grey wool socks, facing left as he looks at Léa with a calm, neutral gaze, his arms loose at his sides. Spilling out across the pale blue runner rug from the bedroom threshold, the flat solid near-black shape of l'ombre stretches its limbs and mimics Léa's exact stance, its dark shadow-foot stamped out against the floorboards. A small warm wall lamp glows beside the white-painted door frame, casting soft light along the cream corridor walls. Medium shot showing both children from head to feet in the hallway.

---METADATA---
{"sceneIntent":"Léa stamps her foot in her purple pyjamas at her bedroom door while Jules watches in his blue pyjamas, and the dark shadow on the floor stamps its foot in matching motion. A wall lamp illuminates the hallway.","characters":[{"name":"Léa","clothing":"nightwear","position":"in front of the bedroom door","depth":"foreground","footing":"ground","expression":"brows pulled down, eyes wide and determined, mouth set firmly"},{"name":"Jules","clothing":"nightwear","position":"beside Léa in the corridor","depth":"midground","footing":"ground","expression":"brows level, eyes watching Léa, mouth relaxed"}],"era":"present day","weather":"none","interactions":[{"character":"Léa","object":"CHR001","where":"stamps her foot toward the shadow","action":"stamping foot","hands":false,"storyRelevant":true,"priority":"essential"},{"character":"Jules","object":"Léa","where":"watches Léa","action":"watching","hands":false,"storyRelevant":false,"priority":"low"}]}

In the quiet upstairs corridor, Léa stands completely still right in the open doorway of her bedroom, facing left. Dressed in her purple cotton buttoned pyjama top, matching purple pyjama trousers, and bare feet, with her brown straight chin-length hair and bangs falling neatly over her forehead, she looks directly down at the floor before her with a steady, attentive gaze, her rounded face calm and her brows relaxed. Lying across the pale wooden floorboards and reaching into the threshold, l'ombre — the flat, featureless solid near-black silhouette with long thin arms and rounded head — stands perfectly motionless directly opposite her, mirroring her upright, stationary posture. The cream-painted corridor walls and the soft glow of the small wall lamp frame the doorway, with the edge of the pale blue runner rug lying quietly beneath her feet. Medium shot focused on Léa and the resting shadow in the threshold.

---METADATA---
