Seen from the bedroom doorway over Marc's shoulder, Marc stands in the immediate foreground, his back to the camera, showing the back of his dark brown wavy hair, the collar of his brown waxed field jacket, and the white henley collar. In his hands, held up into the lower frame, he holds ART002.2, the teal picture book now opened flat with its cream pages spread wide, his brown eyes looking down at the book. Across the cream rag rug in the midground, Léa lies cozily tucked in her single bed under the blue-printed duvet against the wooden headboard, her purple pyjama sleeve showing as her hands hug ART001, Pompon the plush cream rabbit with long floppy ears, close against her chest. Léa's brown eyes sparkle happily as her mouth curves into a warm grin, looking toward the side of her bed. Stretching smoothly along the duvet and the floor beside her mattress, l'ombre lies flat and peaceful, its featureless dark hand lifted in a gentle wave. The pale green walls and a window showing dark autumn trees frame the bedroom in the soft indoor dusk light. Over-the-shoulder shot looking past Marc into the cozy bedroom.

---METADATA---
