On the covered timber footbridge of Holzbrücke, Léa stands whole in frame in the foreground centre, facing the camera with a cheerful, open smile. She wears her standard outfit: a red wool knit cardigan with long sleeves over a white long-sleeve T-shirt, grey corduroy trousers, and brown leather ankle boots, her chin-length brown hair and bangs framing her soft rounded toddler face and bright brown eyes. Directly beside her on the dark wooden floorboards, l'ombre — a flat, solid near-black shadow silhouette with long thin limbs and a smooth rounded head — stands upright, matching her height and pose. The dark timber trusses and diagonal roof braces of the covered bridge rise overhead and frame the straight walkway of dark wooden boards, with narrow slatted wall openings showing the golden and orange foliage of autumn trees on the riverbank outside in the clear afternoon daylight. Wide establishing shot capturing the full height of Léa and the shadow against the historic bridge interior, with text space preserved across the top.

---METADATA---
