In the ground-floor living room, the entire family gathers together in a cozy group facing the camera in the warm afternoon light. Marc sits on the wooden arm of the grey fabric sofa, wearing his brown waxed field jacket, white henley shirt, dark blue jeans, and brown boots, his expression warm and welcoming. On the sofa beneath the knitted throw, Élodie sits in her yellow chunky turtleneck sweater and long black skirt, beside Henri who sits comfortably in his long grey wool overcoat, orange scarf, and brown corduroy trousers, his full gray beard resting above his chest. In the foreground on the red-and-cream wool rug over the wooden floorboards, Jules sits cross-legged in his green hooded fleece jacket, grey T-shirt, and blue jeans, while Léa stands happily between his knees in her red wool knit cardigan, white shirt, grey trousers, and brown leather boots, smiling directly ahead. Wooden bookshelves filled with colourful books line the cream wall, and the side window reveals soft autumn leaves outside. Wide interior shot framing the full family group and the cozy room furnishings, with the lower area open for text.

